{"type": "Annotation", "id": "annotation:041:verify:round-2:f1", "briefing": "briefing:041:verify:round-2", "by": "actor:ensign", "at": "2026-09-04T20:58:28-07:00", "target": "artifact:041:verify:round-2:item-1", "kind": "comment", "body": "F-1 Material owned: AGENTS.md:147 的更正段寫「040 與 041 的 status 為 implement」，但跑更正段自附的掃描指令輸出 040 implement、041 verify、15 張 design。成因是把會隨流程漂移的快照寫進 evergreen 文件，且會隨本票自己推進而繼續惡化。"}
